  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.renars.dev%252fbisect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Zeus_Kitchen/MP_ZeusKitchen_promo.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <img src=\"https://cdn.arrival.studio/mw/mod-pages/SP-banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">《FNAF：Management Wanted》的監控套件 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/management-wanted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FNAF：Management Wanted</a>&nbsp;</span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此模組包含監控攝影機、監控平板電腦以及爬行快捷鍵！非常適合用於 FNAF 披薩餐廳。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AVDORLE.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/management-wanted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.arrival.studio/mw/mod-pages/main-title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1600\" height=\"650\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ovdr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.arrival.studio/mw/mod-pages/discord-btn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"253\" height=\"57\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ovdr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.arrival.studio/mw/mod-pages/youtube-btn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"253\" height=\"57\"></a> <a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.arrival.studio/mw/mod-pages/geckolib-btn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"253\" height=\"57\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AVDORLE.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">將監控攝影機放置在牆壁或屋頂上，然後使用平板電腦右鍵點擊即可使用。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>你可以在生存模式中，使用銅、鐵、紅石和玻璃板來製作攝影機與平板電腦。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">按下 <strong>U</strong> 鍵鎖定攝影機的初始旋轉角度</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">按下<strong> Z</strong> 鍵進行爬行</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">使用 <strong>木棍</strong> 或 <strong>MW 的菲茲扳手（Faz-Wrench）</strong> 來編輯攝影機</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AVDORLE.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.arrival.studio/mw/mod-pages/dev-team.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1054\" height=\"388\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">由 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ovdr\" rel=\"nofollow\">OVDR Studios</a> 與 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/EWPYtZ793j\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clockwork Interactive</a> 製作</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>Zeus</strong> - 程式開發</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>OVDR</strong> - 專案統籌</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>CastIronSkilet</strong> - 模型與貼圖</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>SmollDave</strong> - 物品貼圖</strong></span></p>",
